Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 09:26:43 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] kk: descriptor cost diagnostics

Opt-in disjoint legacy descriptor entrypoint counts and checked monotonic elapsed scopes. Per-device cumulative snapshots and bounded raw calibration; never CPU time.

Class: diagnostics
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-10-23-kk-descriptor-cost-probe-host.md
Offered-upstream: no
